/**
 * Codex.js — the menu's «Заклинания», «Предметы» and «Механика игры» tabs.
 *
 * Spells are grouped into categories. A spell with a stronger «Максима» form
 * is one card with the Maxima in a block of its own (only Protection Maxima keeps its own
 * card: it is a different spell — a sphere instead of a shield). Each spell and each Maxima
 * shows how it is learned outside Creative: from the start or from a scroll (SpellBook.js).
 * say: how to cast; dmg: damage — ONE number for every creature (players too; HP decides the rest);
 * cost: mana there (internally still «fatigue»); max: the Maxima form.
 */

